---
title: "update_claim_pause (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check: self, is_pause
    q_check --> q_error_same: self.is_claim_paused == is_pause
    q_check --> q_update: self.is_claim_paused != is_pause
    q_error_same --> [*]: abort updating_with_same_value()
    q_update --> [*]: self.is_claim_paused = is_pause

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: Aborts if new value equals current value (prevents no-op calls)
        INV-002: When paused, claim_rebates will abort for all users
    end note
